{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model with scvi_n200 RNA and resnet50 image encoders, weighted fusion, and avgpool aggregation in a multiprofile setting. Validation accuracy of 0.6776 and F1 of 0.6464 suggest the multiprofile configuration may benefit from multimodal integration compared to singleprofile baselines. Uncertainty remains about the relative contribution of aggregation methods, fusion strategies, and profile setting complexity, as no direct comparisons with alternative single-modality or aggregation configurations were made."
}

